					You wear <<genitalsword>> <<genitalsintegrity>> $worn.genitals.name<<if $worn.genitals.anal_shield is 1>> with an anal shield<</if>>.
				<</if>>
			<</if>>
			<<if $worn.under_lower.name isnot "naked">>
				<<if $worn.under_upper.name is "naked">>
